Description: R bindings to 'rapidfuzz-cpp', the 'C++' string matching library of the 'RapidFuzz' project by Max Bachmann <https://github.com/rapidfuzz/rapidfuzz-cpp>, whose headers are bundled with the package. Provides a high-performance interface for calculating string similarities and distances, giving 'R' users access to its algorithms for fuzzy matching and text analysis. Supported metrics include Levenshtein, Damerau-Levenshtein, Hamming, Jaro, Jaro-Winkler, Longest Common Subsequence (LCS), Optimal String Alignment (OSA), Indel, Prefix, and Postfix distances and similarities, as well as multiple fuzzy matching ratios. This is an independent binding, not affiliated with or endorsed by the 'RapidFuzz' project.
URL: <https://github.com/StrategicProjects/RapidFuzz>, <https://strategicprojects.github.io/RapidFuzz/>
